[00:00.74]Oh, oh
[00:04.85]Oh, oh
[00:07.83]Stuck in a daydream, in paradise 沉浸在白日梦中的世外桃源
[00:11.91]That summer feeling, uh-uuh-oh 这夏日扑面而来的感觉
[00:16.18]Don’t need no reason, just living life 无需再多缘由 尽情享受当下就好
[00:20.14]No time for sleeping 睡眠大可置之不理
[00:22.34]
[00:23.19]So we broke some hearts and we danced on cars all night long 我们打破拘谨 在车顶彻夜跳舞
[00:27.43]Went to every bar, underneath the stars one by one 足迹遍布了夜空之下的一家又一家酒吧
[00:31.44]You told me to grow up, but I just can’t help myself 你告诉我仍需成长 但我就是无法控制自己
[00:35.45]Maybe I’m messed up, and maybe I need some help 或许我被困瓶颈 需要些的帮助
[00:39.36]
[00:39.76]Yeah I woke up with a headache and my memory’s all gone 我伴随着头痛醒来 记忆全然遗失
[00:43.71]And I spent all of my money on martinis and rum 我把所有的钱花在了马提尼和朗姆酒上
[00:47.80]Now I only got one dollar till the end of the month 现今我只剩一块钱度过这个月
[00:51.89]Should be sorry but not sorry 本该感到抱歉 但没有理由去道歉
[00:55.39]At least I had fun 至少我玩的开心
